      "role": "user",
      "content": "uh, i'm not sure what u mean by the goblin part, can we just stick to the inventory issue? \n\nto answer your question, it's a manual count done every friday by the floor team to verify the automated system's logs. the floor team is pretty experienced, so i don't think it's a simple counting error. the numbers are always just slightly lower than what the system says we should have. it's like they just vanish.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
